DU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-06-15T19:05:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T14:33:58Z","closed_at":"2026-09-25T14:22:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120328","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120328","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120328.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120328.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds NavigationMesh Resource Inspector Preview.\r\n\r\nThis allows users to get basic information about the content of the NavigationMesh resource without loading it into dummy regions for display. Also provides useful meta data like the amount of vertices and polygons to better judge how heavy that resource is.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"331\" alt=\"navmesh_inspector_preview\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8783d09-78cb-409c-b92d-bdce57c501b5\" />\r\n\r\nShares the inspector viewport controls with the Mesh preview that it largely copies all the camera and viewport code from.\r\n\r\nAka the navmesh display can be rotated with the mouse to view from other angles.\r\nDepending on the baked geometry the default camera view might not always be that helpful.\r\n\r\n### Known limitation\r\n\r\nKnown limitation is that the open inspector preview does not auto-update on all changes to the resource.\r\n\r\nThe NavigationMesh Resource does not and can not emit on many setters a changed signal due to its legacy api easily running into a thread deadlock or spiral when changed signals are emitted. E.g. a clear of the navmesh does not update the preview while the region bake does.","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120328/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":14,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120328/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}